{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bbc413320be55cd1e7dc3a6354904eb2950c7ccd0d95e4e535c7ceb3e38e81af","ja":"本番まであと1時間……。\n皆さん、とても険しい表情でしたね。","zh":"距离正式演出还有1小时……\n大家的表情都非常严肃呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"18116f90c2f1232f16b1f947cacfab9409e3aab70569c265166e549b8469cb38","ja":"自分の衣装を見せられる機会は1年に1回だけって\n言ってたから……うぅ、こっちまで緊張してきた！","zh":"因为说过展示自己服装的机会1年只有1次……\n呜呜，连我都跟着紧张起来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"1ecbc537031fcd2bb20c7c2af062756fbe8e8efe79fb02f1737101abd9b95727","ja":"わかります！　みなさんの衣装への熱い思い……\n取材しててすっごく伝わってきましたから。","zh":"我懂！大家对服装倾注的热情……\n我在采访时深深地感受到了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"205ccdd2d4aa2d31d25f5de63aca975243db66e2b4858422acf3c10ad9b0a77d","ja":"うん。衣装にかける気持ちは、みんな一等賞だよね♪\n……あれっ？","zh":"嗯。大家倾注在服装上的心意，全都是第一名呢♪\n……咦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"889fa05c6f06d8d715e72faafd7e28fe36294b34a2c8bb0c8466f227a0a3a588","ja":"た、大変です！　今日出演予定のモデルさんたちが\n交通トラブルで到着が遅れてしまうって！","zh":"不、不好了！今天预定出演的模特们\n因为交通问题要迟到了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"86035214b01762b833584ddd154bd4beec43e878eb43e8abeecea440161cdf4d","ja":"えっ……！？　それじゃあ、他の生徒さんが\n代理出演……とかになるのかな！？","zh":"欸……！？　那么，会变成由其他学生\n代为出演……这样吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"83da76d89ac7258ced95bfdae4836d3a784bbf5399b6706d7c4fd950d35f806c","ja":"それも検討しているそうですが、それだと\nサイズやイメージが合わなくなるそうで……。","zh":"据说也在考虑那种方案，但那样的话，\n尺寸和整体感觉好像就对不上了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"00e6a3a16acc343c722f945506c2b651c03e333728c117d2de19b5a5236e7a7a","ja":"みなさん、あんなに頑張ってたのに……。","zh":"大家明明都那么努力了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8f125ba5b521f342b472865752ebcfc33f7059c68f33ee2dbaeace436112964a","ja":"そうなっちゃったら、とっても悲しいね……\nあ、それじゃあ！","zh":"要是变成那样，真的会很难过呢……\n啊，那既然这样！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"0fcbd59d6a95f3d721dd4046ce42514cff7f3ed42dedc5862d82d83274e6f03d","ja":"私たちが歌っちゃお♪\nモデルさんが到着するまで！","zh":"就由我们来唱吧♪\n直到模特小姐抵达为止！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"cc8e2ba8b7c7ad02efbe84df5cad4ed7aa48ad52f978eeb8dd344b5173e6db21","ja":"……え？　あの、麗花さん……？\nそれはいったい……。","zh":"……诶？那个，丽花……？\n那到底……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"255ace2ac2be0fe41d72ae20b8ffd24182ad6d4624cf6021967ba6192d852912","ja":"私たち、ショーの前にちょっと挨拶する予定\nだったでしょ？　それを……ミニライブにしちゃうの！","zh":"我们原本打算在演出前简单打个招呼\n对吧？结果……要改成迷你演唱会了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1024.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e76ef81fdbd9e159cbc7eca0487f563ae91f9f2d3a07615437d39ae9d86c0ce4","ja":"……ええ～っ！？\nゲリラライブってことですか～！？","zh":"……诶诶～！？\n也就是说要办突击演出吗～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
